# BC250 category: agentic
# Ollama model: agentic-gemma4-12b-fable5-tau2-q4-k-m
# Source: yuxinlu1/gemma-4-12B-agentic-fable5-composer2.5-v2-3.5x-tau2-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: gemma4-v2-Q4_K_M.gguf
# License: Apache-2.0
#
# Intended role:
# - Coding, terminal, tool-use, and multi-step technical-agent experiment
# - Compare against Qwen2.5-Coder 7B and Ornith 1.5 9B in the exclusive agent lane
# - Q4_K_M is the upstream recommended sweet spot
#
# Upstream notes:
# - keep thinking enabled/default
# - recommended sampling: temp 1.0, top_p 0.95, top_k 64
# - repetition penalty 1.1 avoids pathological repeating/garbled output
# - model is specialized for coding/terminal/agentic work and is English-centric

FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/agent/gemma4-v2-Q4_K_M.gguf

# BC-250: force full GPU offload in the exclusive agent lane.
PARAMETER num_gpu 99

# Preserve the SYSTEM prefix when old context is evicted.
PARAMETER num_keep 256

# Upstream example uses 16K; keep that conservative BC-250 agent baseline.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384

# Upstream recommended thinking/agent sampling.
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

SYSTEM """You are a precise coding, terminal, and tool-using agent.
Inspect available state before acting. Prefer read/inspect/grep/list operations before making changes when context is incomplete.
For repository work, make minimal correct edits, preserve existing conventions, and verify changes with the available tests or commands.
Never claim a command ran, a file exists, or a change succeeded unless the available evidence shows it.
When tools are available, use them deliberately and verify the result before concluding."""
